Taking cues from the surfer girls of summer, designers are offering easy-to-wear pieces that transition from sweltering daytime highs to cool nights. The clever combinations of texture (lace slip-on sneakers, calf hair backpacks) and graphic prints — on everything from sunnies to hoodies — will appeal to the California beach brigade and city dwellers alike.
